      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Critical pathways provide an excellent tool for promoting multidisciplinary efforts to develop optimal, cost-competitive plans for managing patient care. The pharmacy department can play a variety of roles in developing and implementing critical pathways. In advocating optimal drug selection and monitoring, pharmacists can help their institutions reduce costs while maintaining or improving quality of care."},
